{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011510/extras/c8b690ebea383e60e2247bd09f8321e5.avif?t=1757871248\" data-has-big width=1560 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC is a visual archive featuring <strong>50 characters</strong> painted by our artists for the base game, with over <strong>300 diverse color variations.</strong> It's meant as a supporter purchase for those who'd like to send a bit of extra coin our way. The archive must be viewed outside of the game (images are separated into character-specific folders).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011510/extras/7e2aa72e3c4b4449c9f5963723701940.avif?t=1757871248\" data-has-big width=1560 height=452 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DLC Contents:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Volume I</i></strong><i> folder, with <strong>15 unique characters and 77 variations</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Volume II</i></strong><i> folder, with <strong>15 unique characters and 79 variations</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Volume III</i></strong><i> folder, with <strong>20 unique characters and 178 variations</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Readme.txt</i></strong><i> file with instructions and links</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The assets come packaged in their full\u00a0<strong>1000x1000</strong> resolutions, as .png files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011510/extras/cebb1b52b4168e22c8900d3bb5a475da.avif?t=1757871248\" width=1030 height=522 /></span></p>